{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act40side_level_act40side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act40side",
  "stageId": "act40side_07",
  "title": "五省盤",
  "storyCode": "OR-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c80ecd1831bee4f541f02f414095d8f4bf0b668439d0be846182ab2becdd6b11",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "text": "你真是命大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "text": "我在大理寺待了這麼多年，進了死獄還有機會活著出來的，你是頭一個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "顧筌",
      "text": "……這樣的結果，在下自己也沒想到就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "text": "哼，你們這些吃墨水的，就是有這個臭毛病。做事只為了一口氣，不考慮後果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "text": "查了這麼久的案子，這麼多年的心血，就換來百珍宴上送上的一道菜，換來一個龍顏大怒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "text": "鬧這麼一齣，落得這個下場，你就滿意了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "顧筌",
      "text": "虞兄教訓得是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "顧筌",
      "text": "可在下所作所為，於忠於義，都問心無愧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "text": "窺見淵鱗者為大不祥，還真是不祥……接下來你如何打算？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "顧筌",
      "text": "調令已經下來，三天後隨外交使團，前往維多利亞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "顧筌",
      "text": "此事過後，我再無可能留在百灶。這樣的安排，也是尚書大人爭取來的結果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "text": "維多利亞？你這副身子，如何撐得過那段路？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "顧筌",
      "text": "蒙恩逢赦，夫復何求。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "顧筌",
      "text": "何況此次去維多利亞，我也算回家了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "text": "那還能算是家嗎？我記得你說，你的妻女都已經亡故了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "顧筌",
      "text": "嗯……很多年前的事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "text": "……你覺得就算我信了你這句話，其他人會信？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "顧筌",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "text": "你能記得當年的事，自然也會有別人記得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "text": "這次回去，你知道會有多少雙眼睛盯著你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "顧筌",
      "text": "該怎麼做……還請虞兄明示。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "text": "借先生人命一用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "text": "你要的清白真相，我給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我第一次來到百灶求學時，印象最深的，是遮天蔽日的高樓和望不到頭的萬家燈火。\n而那燈火的中央，就是禁城。\n危樓千尺，高聳入雲，目不能視。\n老師說，這裡進行的每一項決策、下達的每一道政令，都會影響萬千百姓的生計。責任之重，重於山嶽。\n也因此，這裡應當是每個學子，一生才學得以施展的地方。\n為天地立心，為生民立命。\n然而，當我真的站在這裡，面對這瓊樓玉宇、深宮高牆——\n我感到令人透不過氣的寒意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "梁大人來得真早。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "寧小姐……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "嗯？梁大人看起來好像很驚訝，是不樂意見到我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "怎會……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "只是沒有聽說，寧小姐也要來參加百珍宴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "尚書大人身體抱恙，今年禮部只好由我代他出席了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "是臨時的決定，沒有來得及告訴梁大人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "不過梁大人赴宴的事，好像也沒有打算告訴我啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "我只當是公事……便沒有煩擾寧小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "嗯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "突然想起，尚蜀一別，和梁大人也已有大半年未見。這期間，我們書信都沒有通過幾次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "書信難通，又耽於公務，確實疏於聯絡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "寧小姐怪罪，我無可辯駁……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "哪裡會責怪梁大人呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "梁大人擔任知府時，心中就放不下家鄉的一草一木。如今職責有變，要操心的事只會更多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "可是不知怎麼，只是過了半年，就覺得和梁大人之間好像又變得生分了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "有些話，也說不出口了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "說起來，梁大人應該是第一次參加這百珍宴吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "是……早年在尚蜀為官，與這等政務自是少有交集。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "歷年百珍宴上，往往都是有一些大事要商定的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "不知今年，這場兵戈之事，陛下會如何決斷呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "梁某不敢對上意妄加揣測。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "但梁大人是聰明人，總是能猜對的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "那日，梁大人其實是有事，想要找祖父他商議的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "……在下不敢欺瞞寧小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "不管怎麼說，你願意來見我，我總是開心的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "但恐怕對於梁大人來說，我始終不是可以信賴和託付的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "寧小姐，應該是誤會了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "我沒有責怪梁大人的意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "當初披上這身紅袍，誰不厭惡這些官場陰私？可又不得不做些曲意周旋之事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "寧某雖未身處朝局的中央，但也明白了一個道理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "說真話難，讓別人相信你說的是真話，更難。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "入了這道宮牆，“真心”兩字，是最站不住腳的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "可梁某人，對寧小姐，總是真心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "無論將來發生何事，在下總希望，寧小姐記得——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧辭秋",
      "text": "梁大人，該入席了。我們進去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深廚師",
      "text": "快點快點！最後再確認一遍食材！客人都已經入席了，等命令一下，就要上菜了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深廚師",
      "text": "再清點一遍所有食材，檢查一下燉菜和湯的狀態！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的年輕廚師",
      "text": "九十號灶上的“福壽全”，不知道怎麼的，湯的顏色看起來就是差一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深廚師",
      "text": "怎麼搞的？說了多少遍，切成一寸見方的塊，一點都不能多；十個時辰的火候，一點也不能斷！肯定又是哪個步驟馬虎了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深廚師",
      "text": "唉……！放著放著，我過去看看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "（低聲）喂喂……這裡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你怎麼還穿著這身衣服！是生怕別人注意不到你，還是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "出席正式場合，當然要著正裝……這一套還是我留在家裡備用的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "可這裡是廚房！你就沒有更適合這裡一點的衣服？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "……沒有了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你——\n唉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你們大理寺的調查員，易容打扮什麼的不該是基本功嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "這都是什麼歪理，大理寺少卿又不是什麼見不得光的身分——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "倒是最近這陣子，不知道為什麼總在做些偷偷摸摸的事……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "別廢話了，這套衣服給你。一會你就跟著上菜的隊伍混進宴會現場，到時候你再換上你這身袍子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "好……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "呼……混進這樣的場合，還真是有點緊張……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你說一會你站出來伸冤，萬一惹得真龍大怒，他會不會直接把你抓起來，甚至……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "百珍宴向來有進諫獻言的傳統，何況我們只是要求重審一件證據不齊的舊案，真龍又何必遷怒於我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "只是有一件事……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "你有沒有想過，萬一……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "萬一，我們將這件案子查到最後，得到的真相和我們想的截然不同……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "萬一……你發現，你周圍的一切，都是一個巨大的謊言……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你這又是什麼意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我們做了這麼多事，不就是為了查到一個真相？是謊言就戳破它，還有什麼可猶豫的？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "都已經走到這一步了，我們還有什麼選擇？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "……好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "煌……我覺得，你的父親他，應該是個好人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "嗯？幹嘛突然說這個？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "答應我，一會要是發生了什麼意外，一定先保護好自——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "噓，別說了！來人了，先躲起來！灶台下面！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "都準備好了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "準……準備好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "你負責的這碗長壽麵，雖然簡單，卻也是至關重要的一道菜，不能有一點差錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "明……明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "你……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "雖然我不知道你的師父為什麼不願意來百珍宴，但我相信他挑中你，總歸有他的理由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "這次宴席辦完後，我給你一個機會，來接我的衣缽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "啊？我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "不樂意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "哈哈哈……能當您的徒弟，應該有不少廚師做夢都會笑醒吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "不過我不明白，為什麼您一定要將畢生手藝只傳於一人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "荒唐……你可知這鼎豐樓每一任總廚，挑選徒弟要經過多少道考核？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "遠的不說，我師父編《食經》，整理四大菜系菜譜，經手了幾十年的百珍宴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "在這鼎豐樓廚房，數百個同樣跟著他在廚道上磨礪了多年的廚師裡，師父也只挑了我一人來接班。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "祖祖輩輩傳下來的精貴手藝，豈是能隨隨便便傳人的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "可是，不管多麼精貴的手藝，做出來的菜，總是要給人吃的啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "哈哈……我的意思是說，教出一個廚藝可以和您比肩的徒弟，真的比教出一群廚藝不錯的廚師更重要嗎……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "您教的人越多，會煮飯的人也就越多，更多的大炎人才能吃到更美味的菜不是嗎……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "……歪理邪說，不知敬畏！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "先好好準備你的麵吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "都準備就緒了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉門守軍",
      "text": "玉門已經進入最高戰備狀態，城防武器皆已就位。城中百姓全部遣散，僅餘兩萬戰士、三千天師，隨時可以奔赴戰場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉門守軍",
      "text": "只待軍令。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "……好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "那且看今晚這月色，到底陰晴如何吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉門守軍",
      "text": "將軍，太尉的信使到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "……這個時候？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "信呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉門守軍",
      "text": "那人沒有帶信，他只是送來了……一盒月餅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉門守軍",
      "text": "信使說，太尉有一句話要帶給將軍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉門守軍",
      "text": "“趁熱吃，不可等涼了。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "左公子的確看懂了在下的提示。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "又見面了……左公子，別來無恙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "你……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "不必緊張，這家當鋪關門許久了，不會有人來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "你單獨約見我，是想做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "這不應該反過來問左公子嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "什麼意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "當年逗留百灶的時候，隨興開了這家當鋪，生意也一度興盛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "每天都有客人送來各式各樣的古玩字畫、金玉奇石……結果被我那個喜歡擺弄山河的弟弟順走不少——都擺到他的園林裡去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "最有趣的一點是，光顧這家當鋪的客人都有一個共同點——他們都是有求於我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "……你未免自視過高了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "不過左公子既然還願意來見在下，那不正是說明左公子也想談談？左公子心中疑問，在下或許能夠解答一二呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "我只在意……你們來到百灶，目的究竟是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "如果那個罪人決意在此時與炎國開戰，那等待他的結果只會是自取滅亡——他不會不清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "是啊……我那個哥哥，別無所長，唯獨對這縱橫之術，頗有心得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "左公子可還記得，在玉門出現的那一夥山海眾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "司歲台事後調查復盤，發現其中有另一隻巨獸所化的代理人行動的痕跡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這件事中，望同樣有嫌疑……\n你想說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "左公子當然應該記得，千年前的那場圍獵，大炎領土內的數隻巨獸，要嘛被消滅，要嘛被驅逐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "那司歲台是否想過，他既然能找到其中一隻……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "他找到的，就僅有那一隻嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "這麼多年以來，司歲台始終警惕著他在炎國的一舉一動，是不是忘了去想，他的棋子落在炎國之外的可能性？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "不要小看司歲台的情報……司歲台從未中斷過對那幾隻巨獸的跟蹤觀察。那些巨獸如果有所異動，巨獸學士一定會有所察覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "算算時間，他們應該已經在趕回來的路上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "這份情報，可以當作我送給左公子的一份薄禮。至於要如何使用，左公子可以自行決斷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "為什麼要告訴我這件事？你既然已經與那個罪人同謀，為何要告訴司歲台他的打算？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "實不相瞞……我與那個哥哥雖然是合作，可各自的心思，多少還是有些分別的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "他執意要分出個勝負，我倒是覺得，和和氣氣地把生意做下去更重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "至於為什麼要挑選左公子……就當是我覺得，與左公子投緣吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "什麼……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "我自詡有幾分識人的本事，直覺告訴我，將來還會有與左公子打交道的機會……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "說不定以後，我們兄弟姐妹的生死去向，都要仰仗左公子的決斷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "text": "值此佳節，能和左公子少敘片刻，也算是緣分……希望左公子將來，也能將在下當作可以交談的“人”吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗心大意的廚師",
      "text": "唉喲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "領頭的廚師",
      "text": "怎麼搞的？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗心大意的廚師",
      "text": "對不起！我、我剛才手抽筋了！沒拿穩！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "領頭的廚師",
      "text": "你真是……唉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗心大意的廚師",
      "text": "對不起！我這就去廚房，重新端一盤備餐出來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "領頭的廚師",
      "text": "動作快點！百官都已經入席了，等真龍到場，宴會就要開始了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏的衛兵",
      "text": "大人？您需要幫忙嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏的衛兵",
      "text": "大人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "咳……我是來參加百珍宴的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏的衛兵",
      "text": "與會的各位官員都已入席落座，您怎麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "抱歉……來的路上耽誤了一些時間，我這就進去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏的衛兵",
      "text": "請等一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏的衛兵",
      "text": "這位大人，請出示一下您的百珍宴請柬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "為何？我已經站在這裡，還需要向你出示請柬嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏的衛兵",
      "text": "例行檢查，還請大人見諒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "大人……大人！您東西落下了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "你……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的女子",
      "text": "您剛剛出門走得急，怎麼把最要緊的東西落在家裡了啊。還好讓我看到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏的衛兵",
      "text": "原來是戶部的唐大人，多有得罪了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏的衛兵",
      "text": "沒什麼問題了，宴會馬上就要開始了，還請唐大人儘快入席吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "請柬是我偽造的，只能騙過這一時，還請麟少卿小心行事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "我認得你……你是寧府的小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "我也是煌的朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "我在百珍宴廚師名單上看到了煌的名字，就猜到了你們的打算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "剩下的事，只能在見到真龍之後再請他寬宥了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "那你可知……要是這件舊案重見天日，必定殃及你……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "可這個舊案牽連最深的人，應該是煌才對吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "麟少卿不是已經答應幫煌查明真相了嗎，還有什麼別的好顧忌的呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "何況……麟少卿若真的能讓這件事水落石出，那樣的結果，我求之不得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "多謝……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "為官數載，我也極少踏入這座禁城。\n我看到一幢幢高抵穹宇的宮殿莊嚴偉岸，屹立挺拔。\n我看到宴席繁盛無兩，高朋滿座。燈火如晝，月色入懷。\n可我看不透……\n是誰有意掩蓋那些名字，是誰不願讓真相大白？\n我忽然想起了前輩曾經說過的那句話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "虞澄……你到底，看到了什麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌亂的官員",
      "text": "奇怪，已經是開宴的時間了，陛下怎麼還沒有到啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的官員",
      "text": "莫要著急，陛下事務繁忙，或許是被什麼要緊事牽絆住了一時半刻，我們靜候就是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌亂的官員",
      "text": "之前聽說陛下身體有恙已經有一陣子了，難道真有此事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉穩的官員",
      "text": "噓……別亂說話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "豈有此理！簡直豈有此理！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這裡是什麼地方？你們有什麼道理阻攔朝廷命官？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "何事喧鬧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衛兵",
      "text": "這個人說他是戶部侍郎唐儉，可是我們核對過，戶部的座席分明已經坐滿了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的戶部官員",
      "text": "荒唐！什麼叫“我說我是”？你好好看看我是誰？你看我手中的官印是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "喧囂戛然而止。\n第三聲號角，夜晚戌時。\n明月當空，照得夜色清朗，容不下一絲雜色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宣禮官",
      "text": "正禮——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "百官紛紛起立，屏息凝神，目視宴席最中央的位置。\n待到那道身影出現在主位——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "臣有事要奏！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "火。\n不知從何處騰起的一簇火苗，只藉著一陣秋夜的風，襲捲了整個宴席。\n躥騰的火舌形似奇詭異獸，張牙舞爪，盤桓在宴席上空。\n又一陣風吹來，火焰異獸的身軀高高升起，迅速爆燃膨脹，並發出了令人不安的聲音，彷彿它在大聲地嘶吼著，嗤笑著——\n自它傾瀉而出的幽異火光早已浸染了百珍宴，此刻正閃動著，攀上官員們慌張的臉龐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "這是……怎麼回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
